# flyctl launch added from .gitignore
# --- secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# --- machine-specific MCP config -----------------------------------------
# .mcp.json wires Claude Code to the maintainer's local TRACE checkout via
# an absolute path. Keep it private to each developer's machine; cloners can
# create their own if they want TRACE audit logging.
**/.mcp.json

# --- session handoff (private, regenerated per session) ------------------
# HANDOFF.md is short-lived continuity notes between Claude Code sessions —
# not a public artifact. STATUS.md is the authoritative project state.
**/HANDOFF.md

# --- runtime artifacts (keep dirs via .gitkeep) ---------------------------
**/local-storage/*
!**/local-storage/.gitkeep
**/sent-mail/*
!**/sent-mail/.gitkeep
**/erp-sync-log/*
!**/erp-sync-log/.gitkeep
**/gmail-fixtures/*.generated.*

# --- Python build / tools -------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov
**/.tox
**/.nox
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/*.egg
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# --- OS / editor ----------------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.iml

# --- Playwright / screenshots --------------------------------------------
**/.playwright-mcp
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.png
!**/app/static/*.png
!**/app/static/**/*.png

# --- Logs ----------------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/seed-output.log

# --- Personal working docs (not for the public repo) --------------------
**/deployment-checklist.html

# --- Local AI workspace ---------------------------------------------------
# .claude/ contains hooks and rules that ARE meant to be checked in;
# session-scoped artifacts and runtime locks under it are not.
**/.claude/SCRATCHPAD.md
**/.claude/compact-context.md
**/.claude/sessions
**/.claude/*.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# --- HuggingFace cache (just in case it leaks out of the docker volume) --
**/.cache/huggingface
fly.toml
